(Radon–Nikodym 导数关系, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"31e71a3e39e9a1b8\" href=\"?note=31e71a3e39e9a1b8\" title=\"58-df-radon-nikodym\">58-df-radon-nikodym</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ChangeOfMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ChangeOfMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (本文件定义的换测度关系)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}change\\text{-}of\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ChangeOfMeasure}_S(\\mathbb P,\\mathbb Q,Z,\\Omega,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}(\\mathbb P,\\Omega,\\Sigma)\\land\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}(\\mathbb Q,\\Omega,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{RNDerivative}_S(Z,\\mathbb Q,\\mathbb P;\\Omega,\\Sigma)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}change\\text{-}of\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ChangeOfMeasure}_S(\\mathbb P,\\mathbb Q,Z,\\Omega,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}(\\mathbb P,\\Omega,\\Sigma)\\land\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}(\\mathbb Q,\\Omega,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{RNDerivative}_S(Z,\\mathbb Q,\\mathbb P;\\Omega,\\Sigma)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Change of measure: absolute continuity of probability measures</li>\n<li>Likelihood ratio: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z=d\\mathbb Q/d\\mathbb P\">\\(Z=d\\mathbb Q/d\\mathbb P\\)</span>；共同的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Omega,\\Sigma)\">\\((\\Omega,\\Sigma)\\)</span> 现在是谓词的显式参数。</li>\n<li>Girsanov: drift change preserves Brownian martingale property</li>\n<li>Esscher transform: exponential tilting of measure</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Karatzas and Shreve, Brownian Motion and Stochastic Calculus</li>\n<li>Shiryaev, Probability</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","t